---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-about.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="From Occupational Therapist to Software Engineer — a journey of learning, building, and exploring."
  pubDate={new Date('2026-11-09T12:00:00')}
  heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
  heroImageWidth={480}
  heroImageHeight={720}
  heroImageWidths={[320, 480, 768, 960]}
  heroImageSizes="(max-width: 516px) calc(100vw - 36px), 480px"
>
  <p>
    2025 and 2026 have been two of the most transformative years of my life.
  </p>

  <p>
    From becoming a first-time dad to making the bold decision to transition
    from Occupational Therapy to Software Engineering, life has been full
    of new challenges, unexpected lessons, and exciting possibilities.
  </p>

  <p>
    Welcome to my little corner of the internet — <strong>LeeChih Lab</strong>.
  </p>

  <p>
    This is my personal space to document my journey into Computer Science,
    share what I'm learning, experiment with new technologies, and capture
    bits and pieces of life along the way.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm still learning, building, breaking things, and figuring things
    out one step at a time.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thanks for stopping by, and feel free to reach out.
    I'd love to connect!
  </p>
</Layout>
